    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-Create Telecom Sim Replacement-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM Replacement API allows users to efficiently process batch requests for SIM card replacements. This endpoint is designed for telecom operators and service providers looking to streamline the replacement of lost or damaged SIMs for their customers. By submitting a batch of requests, organizations can save time and improve customer service through quicker response times. Typical consumers of this API include customer support teams and system integrators in the telecommunications sector who need to manage SIM replacements at scale.",
